Utzil is an android of [[Org/Radiant Arms/index|Radiant Arms]], human-presenting and built to a different design than [[Org/Radiant Arms/People/Ichel|Ichel]]: the skin of his arms and collar is left clear, showing a working interior of metal and something fabric-like in place of muscle and tendon. He carries three firearms, a large hand cannon at his hip, a long-barreled rifle on his back, and a barrel mounted under his left arm, which he points at the door before he sees who is knocking. He is forthcoming and offers guests tea, coffee or a wheatgrass smoothie.

He speaks for Radiant Arms when Ichel is away, and it was he who agreed the terms on which the company gave up its berth and Heart to merge into the Party's coalition.
